        "sid": "JOS 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaNuni Yoshuwa, wawombolweli muShitimi amayala ayedi ayi nakwendesha. Wayilili nindi, Yenu mwakatali niituŋa niYeriku. Ayili, ashikeneni mwitala damumbanda chivumbi, ijina dindi Rahaba. Hiyakukama mwenomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulejeli mwanta wakuYeriku, nawu, Lelunawufuku munenzi amayala awanyana kaIsarela, anenzi nakwendesha ituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakuYeriku watumesheli kudi Rahaba, nin di, Idishaku amayala anenzi kuwu deyi, ana waleja mwitala deyi; muloŋa anenzi nakwendesha ituŋa dejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda wanoneni ana amayala ayedi, hakuyisweka, hakwila nindi, Awa amayala mwalala enza kudami, ami kwamihineluka kwafumawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hana helawu hiyakukeŋa kupata kuchisucha mukala, kuneli dehi bwi-i, mayala edika nikwidika. Kwayawu mayalaami kwiluka nehi. Yilonde lenu lufuchi, mwakayikwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komanawayi kandamisha dehi hewulu detala, nayisweki munsachi jafwalakisi yaaliliyi chachiwahi hewulu detala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala ayilondeleli lufuchi munjila yakuya kuYodana, ashikili nikumwaba. Chedikiluwu ana akuya nakuyilondela apata nikupata chenzelu chamukala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hachiduwu kanda akami, yena mumbanda wakandamini hewulu detalahadiŋuwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayilili ana amayala, nindi, Neluki nami Yehova nayinkiitu pidi, twa yifwa dehi mutentu, niantu ejima ashakama mwitu pa chanatiyuwu enu ananowi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tuna tiyi chomishiliyi Yehova meji muKalupa lwŋi Kachinana kumwenjilapenu, himwafuminenu muEjipitu; nimumwayikopeli anyanta ayedi awaAmori, adiŋi kwisninadi daYodana, wowu aSihoni naOŋi, imwajilishili chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chitwa chitiyili, nyichimayetu hiyikunowa; chitwa yitiyili hikwasheli muntu wakúumik aku; muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yenu yena diyi Nzambi wamwiwulu niwahanu heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu, nanochu chinayili chachiwahi, nayilembeli nami nsanyikilenu Yehova, nenu, Twaka yila chachiwahi akumutaŋa watata yeyi. Munyinki chinjikijilu chalala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakahandishi nitata yami, nimamayami, niana kwami amayala, niana kwami awambanda, niyuma yawu yejima, mwakahandishi wumi wetu tubuli kufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala amwilili nawu, Neyimwakabula kushimuna iyi nsaŋu yetu, twakakumina dakuyifwila hanyijimbayenu, chakelayi Yehova natwinki dehi ituŋa twakakwila chachiwahi chakadi kudimbana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena mumbanda hakuyizelumwina mwipwata namwonji, muŋatala dindi dadipi hampwembu yamukala, yena kwindi wadiŋi watuŋa hampwembu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayilili nindi, Yenu kumpidi, akuyilondela akendakayikwata, kabatamenuku mafuku asatu, nichakafuntawu akuyilondela, ninenu mwakayi kwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala amwilili nawu, Kusanyika kuwunatusanyikishi etu kwe tu hitwakawana hoku muŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tala, chitwakenza mwituŋa, yeniyi mbalawanda yichinana wakayikasila mwipwata muwunatuzelumwini, wakapompeshela mwitala deyi nitata yeyi, nimama yeyi, nianakweyi, niakwetala datata yeyi ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwinza wakedika mwitala deyinakuya mumukwakwa, nsaŋu jindi jakamukumina yemweni, oju kwetuhiŋetuku. Yowu wakekala nindi mwitala, neyi akamwila chuma, ojuhi nsaŋu jetu, jakatukumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyi wakashimuna iyi nsaŋu yetu hitwakawana muŋa hakusanyika kuwunatusanyikishuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili nindi, Mwomu nayi mazu enu, mwomutwakelila. Wayilili nindi, Yenu. Hiyakuya. Yena wakasili mbalawanda yina yichinana mwipwata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena ayili, ashikili kumpidi, ajipililuku mafuku asatu, nichafuntiluwu ana ayilondeleli. Ana ayilondeleli ayikepeli kepe-e njila yejima, kuyimonanehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu ana amayala ayedi afu ntili, akunkumukili hampidi, azambukili, enjili kudi mwana kaNuni Yoshuwa, amushimwinini mwejima mwamwenuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwilili Yoshuwa, nawu, Chalala Yehova natwinki dehi etu ituŋa dejima; antu ejima ashakama mwituŋa chana tutiyuwu ananowi dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
